OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fevening, with clear spells. Cloud
OL,7,Fthickening in the early hours, with
OL,8,Ffurther occasionally heavy rain later
OL,9,Fin the night. Winds remaining strong
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FEarly rain soon clearing,
OL,13,Fthen a brighter day with sunny spells,
OL,14,Fmixed with isolated blustery showers,
OL,15,Fsome of which could be heavy. Winds
OL,16,Feasing later in the day.
